# 252-posture implementation lane scope (issue #252): Cloudflare account
# posture S1-S3 — Audit Logs Saga, Security Insights Saga, benchmark-as-checks
# (NOT Steampipe). Read-only Actions on the existing cloudflare Integration
# plus three Saga definitions with full wiring (bindings, executions,
# wrangler workflows, manifest, solution catalogs), posture docs + recorded
# baseline + validator, weekly credential-free CI, focused tests. No new
# Cloudflare primitive (Workflow bindings on the earned primitive); no D1
# migration (findings live on ExecutionHistory); no secrets-path change
# (single provider-global CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN per ADR 005); S4 Terraform
# drift stays fenced OUT (no .tf, no IaC-authoritative set).
